title: Tabs of files of two folders: the file in front decides the folder in view, and bringing the other tab forward shows the other folder
folders: rust-small, git-changes
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: opened .*rust-small.*util\.rs in a tab
expect-log: opened .*git-changes.*steps\.rs in a tab
expect-log: tabs: \[.*rust-small.*util\.rs, .*git-changes.*steps\.rs\], in front: Some\(1\)

wait 3500
tab open {FIX}\rust-small\src\util.rs
wait 1000
tab open {FIX}\git-changes\src\steps.rs
wait 1500
mark second-folder-in-front
wait 450
tab report
tab front 1
wait 1500
mark first-folder-in-front
wait 450
tab front 2
wait 1500
mark second-again
wait 450
tab canvas
wait 1200
mark canvas-on-the-second-folder
wait 450
quit
